  "notes": [
    "patch_softmute.s, patch_mutemode.s, manifest.py and runtime.json are the author's files byte for byte at the pinned commit, from modwerk-modules/mute-modes/, the author's own Modwerk copy (the 0.2.1 sources with Modwerk's MODWERK_EVENTS blocks, plus this version's changes). upstream/README.md, LICENSE and upstream/OCTABAM_LICENSE are unchanged from 0.1.0's record.",
    "0.2.2 moves SHADOW, hook 1's per-frame silenced set, from SRAM 0x80006c66 into the unit after KEYMASK; sambanks/octabam pins that change at a1e0288 (PR #928, merged as the revision above).",
    "0.2.2 also adds KEYHOLD (SC_KEY only, so always with MODWERK_EVENTS): a muted track that has been a side-chain KEY (ev_mute_keep's answer) keeps the post-FX cut until it is unmuted. sambanks/octabam pins the same change at 826d23e (PR #1013). The octabam-form units equal the author's references (plain 970 B, unchanged; SC_KEY 1100 B).",
    "The stock guard digests are 0.1.0's; no hook site changed."
